      "source": "Enable auto replace stuck downloads",
      "affectedLocales": [
        "hi"
      ],
      "finding": "This aria-label enables an option to replace stuck downloads automatically. The Hindi target places “enable” after a standalone imperative and is ungrammatical; use a direct label for enabling automatic replacement."
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src_f017fe1916ffdb89",
      "source": "Are Similar:",
      "affectedLocales": [
        "zh-Hans",
        "zh-Hant"
      ],
      "finding": "The heading is immediately followed by Yes/No values for a boolean comparison result. 相似之处 means “similarities” rather than asking whether the compared items are similar."
    },
